ld of both personal and professional opportunities.\n\n- Wall Street English is a fun, dynamic, experienced, hard-working and friendly working environment that exceed Client expectations every day. Our commitment to quality services and support continues to propel our growth and success. \n\n- We are a premier provider of motivated and highly trained consultants and professional personnel who have the unique skills and expertise necessary to help our Clients meet their individual and business goals in a cost effective manner. \n\n- As a company, weΓÇÖve developed and enforce a Code of Ethics. This code is designed to clarify and solidify the expectations and standards the company sets for its employees. It is our goal to hire only the best qualified people for employment opportunities available whether locally, nationally or globally.\n\n* We provide:\nΓÇó Paid professional training and development\nΓÇó Opportunities for promotion and career development\nΓÇó A professional international working environment\nΓÇó Committed colleagues.\n\n* Benefit:\nΓÇó Competitive salary \nΓÇó Medical insurance\nΓÇó Generous bonus scheme\nΓÇó Paid annual leave\nΓÇó Paid training\nΓÇó Opportunities for advancement\nΓÇó Free unlimited access to the Wall Street English Courses \nΓÇó Professional, fun and exciting work environment\nΓÇó Ample opportunities to speak and practice English\n\nWe are always looking for talented people who have passions for helping people through English education	21 L├¬ Q├║y ─É├┤n, Q. 3	100-499 nh├ón vi├¬n	https://images.careerviet.vn/employer_folders/lot6/112696/102259wallstreet.png
