thing and soft luggage, which are currently exported to over 70 different countries.\n\nGIVI Vietnam as register a substantial growth over the year and now under the guide of Joseph Perucca, the General Director for G.V and Oversea Operational Director from GIVI Italy it as expanded their production capability and coverage of the local market.\n\nToday the company has over 250 employees in the factory, and in addition a sales force which cover, established and support the current network of dealers which is already strong of more than 120 outlets through the Vietnamese territory.\n\nAlthough the use of the boxes is still a novelty within Vietnam, the sales are growing rapidly as the customer start to recognise the benefits and use of the box, which add safe storage space to the bike, and allow to transport essential items in a safe and secure manner.\n\nMotorcyclists recognize the GIVI name as a trusted brand, known for its exceptional reliability, durability and safety. The popularity and constant evolution of the products have sparked a trend of imitation products in the market leading to consumers being duped into buying inferior quality products. This only results in safety and durability issues in the long run. However, now consumers will be able to verify the authenticity of their GIVI products at the GIVI Point the flag store opened in 2013, were the customer is able to see the range of product and solution available for their bike.\n\nProduct range:\n\nCases\nSide Hardbags\nHelmets\nSoft bags and tank bags\nApparels\nWindshield\nMotorbike Accessories\n\nRIDE SAFE, RIDES WITH GIVI!\n\nBikers in Vietnam and around the world will have added safety through our products because our products are undergo strict quality control and testing before being released into the market. Our products are fully compliant with many of the worldΓÇÖs motorcycle safety standards. We also provide our own warranty and customer service support to back our products\n\nOur Vision\n\nTo