Pre-deal ΓåÆ Due diligence ΓåÆ Contract ΓåÆ Launch\n\nCoordinate with internal teams (operations, kitchen, design, marketing, supply chain) to localize and execute the concept\n\nEnsure first store in each market is delivered at flagship quality (design, workflow, customer experience)\n\nPersonally oversee key openings for new markets\n\n4. Financial Strategy & Investment Planning\n\n- Build and validate financial models for each market:\n\nCAPEX requirements\n\nRevenue projections (daily, monthly, annual)\n\nProfit margins and payback period\n\nEvaluate partner financial capacity and operational readiness\n\nWork with CEO on investment strategy (including SOKO co-investment where relevant)\n\nEnsure deals meet minimum return thresholds and strategic value\n\n5. Brand Control & Global Consistency\n\n- Maintain strict control over:\n\nLocation approval\n\nStore design and layout\n\nMenu core structure\n\nKey ingredients and supply chain\n\nBrand identity and marketing direction\n\nEnsure every SOKO location globally delivers a consistent, premium experience\n\nBalance localization with brand integrity\n\n6. Supply Chain & Operational Alignment\n\n- Work with internal teams to expand SOKOΓÇÖs supply chain internationally\n\n- Ensure core ingredients, pastry systems, and packaging are standardized across markets\n\n- Support partners in sourcing and operational setup to meet SOKO standards\n\n- Optimize cost structures while maintaining product quality\n\n7. Partner Management & Performance\n\n- Build long-term relationships with franchise partners and investors\n\n- Monitor performance across markets:\n\nRevenue per store\n\nProfitability\n\nOperational standards\n\nIntervene and restructure when performance is below expectations\n\nDrive continuous improvement and expansion within each territory\n\n8. Internal Leadership & Cross-functional Alignment\n\n- Work closely with:\n\nCEO & Founder\n\nOperations Director\n\nMarketing & Brand Team\n\nFinance & Supply Chain\n\n